{
  "name": "drive-data-logging",
  "description": "Vehicle and robot data logging end to end: choose formats, measure rates and disk, budget storage, sync clocks, record, audit drops, validate, manifest, hash, offload, index, export, anonymize camera data, extract test cases and replay deterministically.",
  "steps": [
